          "path": "_m/g/f/h/1/castle-stalker-wp/castle-stalker-3130545863.jpg",
          "filename": "Castle Stalker (3130545863).jpg",
          "caption": "From the rowing boat...\n\nWe'd only just found out that tours were running from the Cafe up the road.  This was then followed by a mad dash down the hill to catch one of the family members before they rowed over.  We missed them, and assumed we were too late, but he rowed back over and picked us up.  It was well worth it - fascinating to see a castle restored for real family living, rather than one restored as a museum-piece.",
